#
# Rules for the d365fo-xml git merge driver (Merge-D365XmlFile).
#
# A rule selects repeated sibling elements whose order does not matter. When git's
# line-based merge of a file conflicts, the selected siblings are merged as a set:
# elements added on both sides are all kept, deletions and one-sided changes are
# applied, everything else keeps git's line-based merge.
#
# Syntax - one rule per line, lines starting with '#' are comments:
#
#   <xpath> [key=<xpath>]
#
#   <xpath>  XPath 1.0 selecting the order-independent elements. Element names are matched
#            by local name, so do not use namespace prefixes (also for namespaced files).
#   key=     Optional XPath evaluated on each selected element. Its string value
#            identifies the element in base/ours/theirs (case-insensitive):
#              changed on one side only                -> that change is taken
#              changed on both sides                   -> line-based merge of that element
#              added on both sides with other content  -> conflict
#              deleted on one side, changed on other   -> conflict
#            Without key the whole element (with its subtree) is the identity: a change
#            is a removal plus an addition, so same-name duplicates are not detected.
#
# Lookup order: -RulesPath, $env:D365GITOPS_XML_MERGE_RULES, <repository root>/.xmlmergerules,
# then this file (shipped with the D365GitOps module).
# Create a customizable copy: Merge-D365XmlFile -ExportDefaultRules ./.xmlmergerules
#
# Only list collections whose element order has no functional meaning. Do not add ordered
# ones such as form controls, menus, enum values, index fields or field group fields.

# --- X++ source code ----------------------------------------------------------------
/AxClass/SourceCode/Methods/Method key=Name
/AxTable/SourceCode/Methods/Method key=Name
/AxView/SourceCode/Methods/Method key=Name
/AxDataEntityView/SourceCode/Methods/Method key=Name
/AxMap/SourceCode/Methods/Method key=Name
/AxQuery/SourceCode/Methods/Method key=Name
/AxForm/SourceCode/Methods/Method key=Name
/AxForm/SourceCode/DataSources/DataSource key=Name
/AxForm/SourceCode/DataSources/DataSource/Methods/Method key=Name

